{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":241,"count":37,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L06-2-15\",\"骑\",\"騎\",\"骑\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個週末我們要去騎腳踏車／自行車。","pinyin":"Zhè ge zhōumò wǒmen yào qù qí jiǎotàchē/zìxíngchē.","english":"This weekend we are going to ride bikes.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-16","sourceFront":"腳踏車/自行車","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你不要常常在家上網、看電腦、玩手機，應該去運動。明天我有空，我們可以一起去騎腳踏車。","pinyin":"Nǐ búyào chángcháng zài jiā shàngwǎng, kàn diànnǎo, wán shǒujī, yīnggāi qù yùndòng. Míngtiān wǒ yǒukòng, wǒmen kěyǐ yìqǐ qù qí jiǎotàchē.","english":"Don’t surf the internet, use the computer or play on the cell phone at home often. You should go exercise. I am available tomorrow. We can go ride bikes together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L07-1-14\",\"火车\",\"火車\",\"火车\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在這個大車站，坐公車、捷運、火車都很方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-07","sourceFront":"車站","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"火車應該快到了，我們去前面排隊吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-22","sourceFront":"應該","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週末到花蓮的火車票一下子就賣光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-19","sourceFront":"光","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我要搭火車去東部，座位是3車16號。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-28","sourceFront":"座位","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"搭火車的時候，我喜歡坐在窗戶旁邊的位子，邊聽音樂邊看風景。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-29","sourceFront":"位子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到東部的火車票很難訂，我訂了好幾次才成功。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-23","sourceFront":"成功","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週末的時候，火車站的賣票窗口總是排滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-32","sourceFront":"窗口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，退火車票得早一點兒，越晚退的話，扣的錢也越多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-46","sourceFront":"退","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，上網訂好火車票後，可選擇到車站或便利商店取票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-21","sourceFront":"取","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"坐火車時，一旁的旅客不停地講電話，吵得我受不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-43","sourceFront":"一旁","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L07-2-06\",\"邮局\",\"郵局\",\"邮局\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"（看地圖）啊！天美飯店在這裡！我知道這個地方，附近有郵局跟超級市場。","pinyin":"(Kàn dìtú) A! Tiānměi Fàndiàn zài zhèlǐ! Wǒ zhīdào zhè ge dìfang, fùjìn yǒu yóujú gēn chāojíshìchǎng.","english":"(Looking at the map) Ah! So here is Tianmei Hotel! I know this place. There is a post office and a supermarket nearby.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-01","sourceFront":"路/馬路","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-3-07\",\"读书\",\"讀書\",\"读书\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現在我非常忙，沒有很多時間讀書，可是因為有語言交換，所以我的中文進步了。","pinyin":"Xiànzài wǒ fēicháng máng, méi yǒu hěn duō shíjiān dúshū, kěshì yīnwèi yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, suǒyǐ wǒ de Zhōngwén jìnbù le.","english":"Nowadays, I am very busy; I don’t have much time for studying. However, because of language exchange, I have improved (my Chinese) a lot.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L11-2-03\",\"經驗\",\"經驗\",\"经验\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你可以告訴我學中文的經驗嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L11-2-03","sourceFront":"經驗","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我只參加過籃球比賽，其他運動比賽我都沒有經驗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-3-10","sourceFront":"其他","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們的成長經驗、教育背景都差不多，所以想法也很像。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-22","sourceFront":"背景","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個我覺得最難忘的回憶應該是跟「第一次」相關的經驗，比如第一次戀愛、第一次當背包客等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-15","sourceFront":"難忘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"五年前經驗過護照被偷的意外後，每次出國我都把護照放在上衣裡面的口袋。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-23","sourceFront":"經驗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母不能保護孩子一輩子，得讓他們自己經驗一些挫折，才能培養出堅強的性格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-04","sourceFront":"堅強","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:對這次新產品的銷售方式，你有什麼想法？ B:我在這方面沒什麼經驗，你可以去請教方經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-07","sourceFront":"方面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"利用暑期打工不只可以賺點兒零用錢，還可以增加工作經驗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-10","sourceFront":"暑期","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位演員有劇場表演的經驗，所以導演決定用他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-03","sourceFront":"劇場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上星期電視臺的人來訪問我們，請我們談談學習華語的經驗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-22","sourceFront":"電視臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有煩惱，如果能好好處理，就能從過程中得到經驗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-06","sourceFront":"煩惱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都得經驗老病死，這些都是自然發生，避免不了的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-50","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在指導演員的表達方式上，這位導演的經驗相當豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-10","sourceFront":"指導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從事新工作時往往經驗不足，因此向別人請教是必需的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-07","sourceFront":"不足","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"別怕失敗，因為失敗的經驗比成功更珍貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-10","sourceFront":"失敗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Passing through (經) and verifying (驗) things gives you experience."},{"key":"[\"B1L14-2-13\",\"汤\",\"湯\",\"汤\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"天氣熱的時候，我不喜歡喝熱湯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-2-13","sourceFront":"湯","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"媽媽煎了一條魚，又煮了蘿蔔湯，看起來都很好吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-20","sourceFront":"煎","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"秋天的天氣變化很大，早晚都有點涼，出門時最好帶件外套。 這碗魚湯要趁熱喝，涼了就不好喝了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-22","sourceFront":"涼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"導遊忘了跟小湯約好在紅毛城門口見面，害他白（白）等了一個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-11","sourceFront":"白白","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在吃湯麵之前淋上點兒芝麻油，吃起來味道更好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-38","sourceFront":"淋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-22\",\"下雨\",\"下雨\",\"下雨\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從昨天晚上到現在，已經下了十個小時的雨了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-23","sourceFront":"雨","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我今天本來想去看電影，後來下雨就沒去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-02","sourceFront":"後來","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我們在逛夜市的時候，忽然下雨了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-02","sourceFront":"忽然","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我討厭下雨，因為出去玩很不方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-31","sourceFront":"討厭","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們正在烤肉的時候，忽然下雨了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-13","sourceFront":"正在","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個地區是個危險地帶，因為經常一下雨就有石頭掉下來，有時候連路都會塌了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-06","sourceFront":"地帶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次社區的中秋節活動，決定在戶外舉辦，萬一下雨了就搬到室內去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-09","sourceFront":"室內","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天電視臺的氣象報告說今天會下雨，果然一大早就下起雨來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-52","sourceFront":"果然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這條公路很危險，一下大雨，山上的石頭就會掉下來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-17","sourceFront":"下來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要不是下大雨，我們就去動物園玩了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-22","sourceFront":"要不是","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下了好幾天的大雨，不但到處淹水，連我家養的雞、鴨也淹死了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-17","sourceFront":"淹","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從這裡走路回家有一點兒距離，而且現在還下著大雨，我們還是搭計程車算了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-31","sourceFront":"距離","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"東部山區一連下了好幾天的大雨，有些房子倒了，公路也塌了，造成不少意外。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-13","sourceFront":"山區","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市一連下了五天的雨，造成很多地區淹水，三分之一的路不通了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-13","sourceFront":"之","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在突然下起了大雨，我們的計畫被破壞了，恐怕今天所有的活動都必須重新安排。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-18","sourceFront":"重新","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天空突然下起了大雨，我的衣服和頭髮都濕了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-20","sourceFront":"溼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們爬山爬到一半就起風了，過了幾分鐘就下起大雨來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-23","sourceFront":"起","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天棒球賽進行到一半時突然下起了大雨，雖然後來雨停了，但因為球場太溼，也無法繼續比賽了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-16","sourceFront":"進行","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"外面下著大雨，路很滑，請小心開車。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-27","sourceFront":"滑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"窗外正下著大雨，我又沒帶傘，看來得在公司多留一會兒了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-29","sourceFront":"看來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下過雨後道路比較滑，開車時速度別太快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-06","sourceFront":"道路","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"下(down) + 雨(rain): rain coming down means \"to rain\"."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-2-15\",\"幸运\",\"幸運\",\"幸运\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他玩遊戲贏了一萬塊錢，真幸運！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-15","sourceFront":"幸運","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他參加百貨公司的活動，抽到一台價格六萬元的平板電腦， 真是太幸運了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-11","sourceFront":"抽","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小李第一次參加釣魚比賽就得了第一名，真是幸運。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-01","sourceFront":"得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-2-27\",\"阿里山小火車\",\"阿里山小火車\",\"阿里山小火车\",\"Name\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-2-05\",\"東南\",\"東南\",\"东南\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"日本在台灣的東北方；台灣在中國的東南方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-05","sourceFront":"東南","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"日本在台灣的東北方；台灣在中國的東南方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-03","sourceFront":"東北","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L05-1-13\",\"電燈\",\"電燈\",\"电灯\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"科學家發明了電燈，改變了人類的生活方式，也大大提高了生活品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 電(electricity) and 燈(lamp): 電燈 means electric light."},{"key":"[\"B3L07-1-05\",\"部落格\",\"部落格\",\"部落格\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在王小姐的部落格裡，除了有她的旅遊日記，還有在非洲大草原騎馬的相片。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-06","sourceFront":"日記","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"紀先生的部落格擁有不少讀者，下個週末他要辦一場新書活動，買了新書的讀者都可以請他簽名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-09","sourceFront":"讀者","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A web space where 部(department) posts 落(fall) into a neat 格(form) grid: 部落格 means blog."},{"key":"[\"B3L07-1-18\",\"頭\",\"頭\",\"头\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我咳嗽、頭痛，鼻子也不舒服。","pinyin":"Wǒ késou, tóu tòng, bízi yě bù shūfu.","english":"I have a cough and headache. Also my nose is uncomfortable.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 豆(beans) basket sits above the 頁(head) → balanced on your 頭(head)."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-2-19\",\"毕竟\",\"畢竟\",\"毕竟\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他畢竟是個小孩子，還不懂做人做事的道理，等他長大就會明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-19","sourceFront":"畢竟","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L13-1-04\",\"電子書\",\"電子書\",\"电子书\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A digital 電(electricity) device with particle 子(child) to read a virtual 書(book): 電子書 means ebook."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-17\",\"以来\",\"以來\",\"以来\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"張先生夫婦自從結婚以來，不曾吵過架，因為兩人的脾氣都太好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-17","sourceFront":"以來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"許多世紀以來，受壓迫的民族都渴望擁有平等的待遇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-40","sourceFront":"壓迫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從政府宣布石油、電費雙漲的作法以來，反對的民眾人數已近七成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-46","sourceFront":"近","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-44\",\"来信\",\"來信\",\"来信\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"前天我收到大學的來信，才知道我被錄取了，真開心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-44","sourceFront":"來信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-29\",\"结帐\",\"結帳\",\"结帐\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"吃完飯到櫃臺結帳前，應該先看清楚帳單有沒有錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-29","sourceFront":"結帳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-33\",\"鮮奶\",\"鮮奶\",\"鲜奶\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"鮮奶是做冰淇淋、甜點不可少的東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-33","sourceFront":"鮮奶","sourceBookId":4,"s